      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "for easier navigation."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 135,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Morocc Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Your Mini-Map is located"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 137,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "in the upper right corner"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 138,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "of the screen. If you can't"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 139,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "see it, press the Ctrl + Tab"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 140,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "keys or click the ''Map'' button in your Basic Info Window."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 142,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Morocc Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 143,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "On your Mini-Map,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "click on the ''+'' and ''-''"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 145,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "symbols to zoom in and"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 146,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "our of your Mini-Map. We"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 147,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "hope you enjoy your travels"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
